# Used by `docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Allowlist: only what the image needs. Everything else (your .env, vault/, work/, profile.md, tests) stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!reelvault/
!migrations/
!extension-members/
!deploy/requirements.lock
!deploy/fetch_models.sh
!deploy/build_extension.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite*
reelvault/**/node_modules
migrations/__pycache__
